WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.135
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:05.871
We're about to play a game
called "What's Behind Me?"

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:08.007
My partner tonight is
a talented actress

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:09.476
and successful entrepreneur,

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.844
who is the founder of
The Honest Company.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:15.015
Please give it up for
the one-and-only Jessica Alba!

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.916
[ Cheers and applause ]
Oh, come on!

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.384
Thank you for being here.
It's so good to see you.

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.520
-Thank you for having me.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.955
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:24.757
Jessica and I will take turns
facing our backs to the curtain.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.225
Behind the
curtain will be something

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:27.593
neither of us have seen before.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.963
It could be
people, objects, anything.

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.098
Once the curtain opens
and you pick up your card,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.734
you have 45 seconds to try to
get the other person

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:35.969
to guess what's behind them.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.737
You can say anything
you want or use gestures.

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:41.507
You just can't say any of
the words on your card.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:43.710
Jessica,
you'll be guessing first.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.178
Let's get into position.
-Okay.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:50.482
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.482 --> 00:00:51.617
-Okay, Jessica.

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:52.652
-That was scary.
-I know.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.087
It's kind of fun, right?

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.956
Jessica, let's open the curtain
and see what's behind you.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:57.956
-Okay.

00:00:57.956 --> 00:01:00.193
-Alright, here we go.

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:07.834
Okay. Alright, here we go.
Ready?

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:12.104
Okay. Alright,
it's a Dr. Seuss character.

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:13.906
-A cat.
-The other one.

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:14.941
A holiday.
-A fish?

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:15.942
-Yes.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:16.943
-Fish?
-No.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.144
-No.
-Holiday.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.179
-Ugh!

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:21.647
A dog?
-He stole Christmas.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:22.948
-Oh, The Grinch.
-Yeah.

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:24.350
[ Ding ]

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.787
A movie with Julia Roberts where
she finds herself in Italy.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.789
-"Eat Pray Love."
-That's correct.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.558
And it's in a transportation
device that --

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:36.629
It floats in the -- It floats.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.898
And you're in a basket.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.433
-Oh, a hot-air balloon.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:41.867
-That's correct.
We did it right there.

00:01:41.867 --> 00:01:45.871
The Grinch reading
"Eat Pray Love"

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:46.906
