00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.908
Now look at -- See the --
-Oh, my God.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.310
-Wow!
-It's real.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.343
-Oh, my God.

00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:52.845
I don't like that Grinch
looking at me.

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:54.046
That was very odd.

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:56.449
Well, he's enjoying the book.
He's thinking.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.285
-I had no idea it was going to
be, like, a real thing.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.787
-Oh, yeah,
these are real things.

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.622
Yeah.
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:05.191
Alright, here we go.
Now it is my turn to guess.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.359
-Okay.
-Let's rotate the stage.

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.194
-Okay.
-Alright, here we go.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.328
